We will be using the psych package again today. For those who are not ready, please install the package from the Package tab, or enter install.packages("psych") in the console to introduce the package.

% データセットも\texttt{psych}パッケージが持っているものを使います。
We will use the dataset that the \texttt{psych} package has.
